ects Students Instructors People Contacts Inclusive Community Forum Back Inclusive Community Forum Overview Community Employability Back Employability Overview Inclusive Journey Recruitment Peer2Peer Process Education Back Education Overview Inclusion Labs Process Empower to Employ Inclusion Projects Team Contacts Press Clipping VCW Lab Back VCW Lab Overview Projects Education Publications People Nova SBE Teaching & Innovation Center Back Nova SBE Teaching & Innovation Center About us Our offer Faculty Hub Project-Based Learning Teaching Excellence Community Impact Get Involved Institutes Back Institutes Nova SBE Haddad Entrepreneurship Institute Back Nova SBE Haddad Entrepreneurship Institute Overview Students Startups Research People What’s Happening Contacts Mentors Network Nova SBE Westmont Institute of Tourism & Hospitality Back Nova SBE Westmont Institute of Tourism & Hospitality Overview Education Global Research Societal Outreach Africa People Contacts Digital Data Design Institute Back Digital Data Design Institute Overview AI X Lab Learning Pathways Join as a partner! People Events Contacts News Nova SBE Public Policy Institute Life at Nova SBE Overview About the campus Getting started Student Support Community Engagement Well-being FAQ International Students Nova Way of Life What's Happening Newsroom Back Newsroom Overview Specialists Media Kit Contacts Press Releases News Events RRP @ Nova SBE Programs Bachelor's in Economics Overview Careers & Placement FAQ Apply Program Student Advising Fees Find a meaningful career Our office’s mission is to guide and empower our students throughout their career journey - helping them make informed decisions, navigate the global job market, explore opportunities, and build a professional path aligned with your goals and strengths. Self- Awareness Market Knowledge Career Plan Recruitment Processes Meaningful career How it works Career Workshops Our career workshops give you practical tools to help you stand out - whether you’re improving your CV, learning how to deliver a strong pitch, or exploring your career options. 1:1 Career Counselling You will deepen your knowledge about yourself and use that insight to make more informed decisions about your next steps. In 1:1 counselling sessions, you’ll get guidance when you’re unsure and practical support to help you prepare for job interviews and navigate recruitment processes. Online Tools You’ll have access to online tools that support your market research, job search, and recruitment preparation - including JobTeaser, Career Set, Big Interview, Graduate First, and Case Coach. Corporate Events By joining Corporate Events, you’ll meet employers, learn what different companies are really like, and get a better understanding of today’s job market. Career Fairs Two exclusive events to meet and network with recruiters from leading national and international companies. Career Center by JobTeaser The JobTeaser portal, from the Nova SBE Career Services team, connects students to the job market, providing access to job offers and corporate and career events. Career Opportunities Studying Economics at Nova will get you places 100% of Economics bachelor’s graduates who choose to enter the job market instead of pursuing a master’s degree receive a job offer up to 6 months after graduation. Main industries Finance / Banking Consulting / Auditing Popular recruiters Banco de Portugal Boston Consulting Group BNP Paribas Deloitte EY Jerónimo Martins L'ORÉAL Nestlé PwC Roland Berger Santander Totta SONAE Popular International Placement Countries Angola Belgium Germany Luxembourg Spain Switzerland The Netherlands United Kingdom Where we are To find out about the ways the Nova SBE Career Services team can support you and other helpful information, meet us at our office D124. Contact (+351) 213 822 792 E-mail: careers@novasbe.pt Share Facebook Twitter LinkedIn Email Contacts Contacts & Directions Ecosystem Students Alumni Research Knowledge Centers Shortcuts Join our School Regulations & Public Announcements Fundação Alfredo de Sousa Library Nova SBE Today Moodle@NovaSBE Webmail Student Hub Whistleblower Portal Follow us Facebook Twitter Instagram LinkedIn Youtube Accredited by: Member of: Participant in: Recovery and Resilience Plan (RRP) Privacy Policy Cookies Policy Back to top"
